### Component 2: Query Expansion & Retrieval Engines (`com.medisense.rag.retrieval`)

#### [NEW] [HyDEQueryExpander.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/retrieval/HyDEQueryExpander.java)
- Gemini Flash hypothetical answer generator prompt.
- Fallback to direct query embedding if LLM is unavailable or fails.

#### [MODIFY] [DenseRetriever.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/retrieval/DenseRetriever.java)
- Execute `pgvector` cosine similarity search with parameterized metadata pre-filtering (`is_active = TRUE`, `evidence_basis`, `domain_tags`).

#### [MODIFY] [SparseBm25Retriever.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/retrieval/SparseBm25Retriever.java)
- Execute Lucene BM25 keyword search over local `FSDirectory` index.
- Normalize raw BM25 Lucene scores to $[0, 1]$.

#### [NEW] [RRFRanker.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/retrieval/RRFRanker.java)
- Implement RRF formula: $\text{score}(c) = \frac{1}{60 + r_{\text{dense}}} + \frac{1}{60 + r_{\text{sparse}}}$.
- Handle deduplication by `chunkId` and sort descending.

#### [NEW] [ParentChunkFetcher.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/retrieval/ParentChunkFetcher.java)
- Query `ParentChunkRepository` for `parent_chunk_id` of top-5 child chunks and assemble `List<RetrievedContext>`.

#### [MODIFY] [HybridRetrieverService.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/retrieval/HybridRetrieverService.java) & [RetrievalOrchestrator.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/retrieval/RetrievalOrchestrator.java)
- Coordinate HyDE expansion, parallel dense + sparse retrieval (`CompletableFuture.supplyAsync`), RRF ranking, and parent context fetching.

